# Local-only material and editor/tool state
_internal*
.claude

# Build output. (gitignore has no inline comments, hence the comment lines.)
# jake/OrcaSlicer scratch (3MFs, etc.)
build/
# per-page SVGs, regenerated by `jake rulebook`
rulebook/svg/
__pycache__/
node_modules/
# Blender autosaves alongside scripts/blender/assemblies/*.blend
*.blend1
# OrcaSlicer CLI status dump, written into the working directory
result.json
# wrangler's local state cache (account id, deploy bookkeeping)
.wrangler/

# Sub-project build output is ignored by that project's own .gitignore:
#   nuxt-site/.gitignore        .output/ .nuxt/ .data/ dist/ and the
#                               public/_headers + public/_redirects copies
#                               that build.sh stages there
#   tools/bitty-cad/.gitignore  dist/

# ── Paid (non-base-game) STL payloads ─────────────────────────────────
# These sets are sold, not free, and they are kept out of the repository in
# two independent ways, because these are two different problems:
#
#   1. Not committed — this file. A committed binary is recoverable from
#      every clone forever, even after a later `git rm`.
#   2. Not served — paid-sets/ sits OUTSIDE assets/. The Nuxt site symlinks
#      nuxt-site/public/assets -> ../../assets, so every file under assets/
#      is published as a static asset and downloadable by anyone. Ignoring a
#      file does nothing to stop that; only keeping it out of the published
#      tree does. These models previously lived in assets/stls/ and were
#      served publicly by a deploy. Do not move them back.
#
# scripts/publish-paid-sets.sh uploads from here to R2, which is the only
# place buyers are served from, through an entitlement check in the Worker.
#
# Only payloads are ignored. Each set.json manifest IS tracked: it carries
# the version of record and holds nothing sellable.
# Excluded file-by-file rather than as whole directories: git will not look
# inside an excluded directory, so a `paid-sets/**` rule would make the
# set.json negation below unreachable.
paid-sets/*/*
!paid-sets/*/set.json

# Local deploy helper (SSH alias + server paths for this machine only)
deploy.sh
